{"title":"2013 Mock AIME I Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_Mock_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/1/441416e660d25335f27e55334ac2a06e51541c97.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor x\\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"19\" /> be the greatest integer less than or equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, and let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/f/eefa9c7e0a1e3e82de66018f99631a9e5b9e9c26.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{x\\}=x-\\lfloor x\\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"109\" height=\"19\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/5/ac5387384ac2ee9b5617cf02bd2a98be93ea34fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=(7+4\\sqrt{3})^{2^{2013}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"146\" height=\"24\" />, compute <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/f/64f7086b8f404f1363cd5a12a95cabf3ec81e536.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\left(1-\\{x\\}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_Mock_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/9/129c5f2eae38adcfd7cda5e4bec628788bc633cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=(7-4\\sqrt{3})^{2^{2013}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"140\" height=\"23\" />. Notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/c/17c39e6f5e11436ff27749b0dd251d4487d9d1c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y&lt;&lt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"56\" height=\"15\" /> and that, by expanding using the binomial theorem, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/d/d3da9f8c7fe0473fdd6f8597eff61d71fedda430.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"16\" /> is an integer because the terms with radicals cancel. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/d/d1d4d96b4e501b9ede8a5e24af6ac4b24b7846f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=1-\\{x\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"92\" height=\"18\" />. The desired expression is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/e/6cec5132f464d4cb380d1e992ac7d4bbf2c481da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\left(1-\\{x\\}\\right)=xy=((7+4\\sqrt{3})(7-4\\sqrt{3}))^{2^{2013}}=\\boxed{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"403\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_Mock_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_Mock_AIME_I_Problems\" title=\"2013 Mock AIME I Problems\">2013 Mock AIME I Problems</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_Mock_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2013 Mock AIME I Problems/Problem 2\">Preceded by Problem 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_Mock_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2013 Mock AIME I Problems/Problem 4\">Followed by Problem 4</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017232815\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.008 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.010 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 58/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1914/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:14525:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017232815 and revision id 223958. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}